	     classic in-process VSSDK package whose build tasks are .NET Framework MSBuild tasks, and
	     this solution is gated by `dotnet build`. It lives in
	     extensions/VisualStudio/Assimalign.Viu.VisualStudio.slnx and is built by
	     extensions/VisualStudio/Build.ps1 through Visual Studio's MSBuild. Its test project stays
	     here, because it compiles the editor-free sources through <Compile Include> links rather
	     than referencing the package. -->
